description: Prefer reusable helpers and components over duplicated one-off logic
alwaysApply: true
---

# Reuse first

When the same decision or presentation appears more than once, extract a named
helper, hook, or component and call it from every call site.

## Do

- Resolve work chrome via `scenarioForWork(work, scenarios)` — never
  `scenarios[work.scenario]` for display when `source` may be `"engine"`.
- Put pure logic in small modules (`conversation-*.ts`, `*-client.ts`, domain
  ports) instead of growing shell files.
- Extend an existing port/helper before adding a parallel path.

## Don't

- Copy UI labels, agent names, or engine/simulation branching into a second place.
- Leave `scenario: 0` (or similar demo indexes) as the source of truth for
  engine-backed UI chrome.
- When Fonte=motore but the engine is down, fall back to simulation create
  (Marta demo). Stay on the engine path with an empty list + gate error —
  use `resolveWorkspaceMode`.
